        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect that, after a rigorous, multi-year product design and engineering validation process, customers would select our solutions to be designed into specific final product models, and our solutions would be sold at agreed rates per unit for the customer’s product programs.",
